ffect. A subtle sparkle or bokeh effect is visible in the upper part of the image, adding to the dreamy, fantasy-like quality.\n\n**Text Elements:**\nAt the top of the image, the title \"Krea2\" is prominently displayed in a large, elegant, white serif font. Below it, the words \"Asian-Mix\" appear in a smaller, pink sans-serif font, followed by \"DayDream Series\" in a delicate, white script font. These text elements are integrated into the design, appearing as if they are part of the sky or the floral arrangement, contributing to the overall whimsical and romantic theme.\n\nOverall, the image conveys a sense of tranquility, beauty, and youthful optimism, perfectly encapsulating the essence of a \"DayDream Series.\" It's designed to be visually appealing and emotionally engaging, likely aimed at a fashion or lifestyle audience."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 159, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [490.320068359375, 498.8816223144531], "pos": [-2217.577392578125, 1763.563720703125], "id": 98, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "BOOLEAN", "links": [151], "label": "BOOLEAN", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "BOOLEAN"}], "color": "#f37c7c", "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveBoolean", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#df6868", "size": [220.3668670654297, 58], "pos": [-4325.408203125, 440.6057434082031], "id": 92, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveBoolean"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "BOOLEAN", "links": [158], "label": "BOOLEAN", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "BOOLEAN"}], "color": "#ff9090", "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"},